# Dancing Stage featuring TRUE KiSS DESTiNATiON (G*884 VER. JAA), Konami 1999: first power-on from blank NVRAM, no inputs. Hashes the main RAM every frame and
# snapshots every 60 frames, to compare with MAME.
game dsftkd

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

from 0 every 60 snap
at 6000 quit
